msgid "Home"
msgstr "Logement"

msgid "The page of one home, at `/h/<home id>/`: its name, your role in it and its currency. Its address stays the same as long as the home exists."
msgstr "La page d'un logement, sur `/h/<home id>/` : son nom, votre rôle et sa devise. Son adresse ne change pas tant que le logement existe."

msgid "The page of a home, on a phone."
msgstr "La page d'un logement, sur téléphone."

